This is a framework to demonstrate how the contracts work when you perform different operations in ArrayList (in C#). The test methods defined in this class are designed to observe the old and new state of ArrayList and the resultant change of ArrayList after each insertion/deletion/modification operation. This can verify the correctness of each operation in ArrayList by observing the change in ArrayList's state before and after the operation is done. 

